#   color_interpolation_2 - color interpolation: powerless components, the interpolation
#   space, premultiplication and the result
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/ColorInterpolation.cpp lines 522-1010:
#       perform_color_interpolation, interpolate_color, style_value_for_interpolated_color
#       and the steps they use. color_interpolation_1 holds the conversions and missing
#       components. C++'s internal-linkage functions are private.
